        <body>
            <div xml:id="d470">

                <pb facs="0849" n="835" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v1/pg835"/>

                <head><seg type="margin">[153]</seg> *<hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Harlow, deputy
                        United States marshal, to Mr. Fish, Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Marshal’s Office,
                            Southern District of New York</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                            York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1869-08-19"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">August</hi> 19, 1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to forward the following
                    additional information relative to the Hornet, gathered by my detectives. I have
                    telegraphed you that McNulty and DuBose, who are said to be on board the Hornet,
                    were arrested here for a violation of the neutrality laws, and were discharged
                    on their own recognizance.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S. R. HARLOW,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Deputy Marshal</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hamilton Fish</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d470-a1.xml" xpointer="d470-a1"/>
